    <string name="settings_capture_summary">How EDM receives links from browsers</string>
    <string name="settings_capture_dialog_title">Browser capture</string>
    <string name="settings_capture_dialog_text">EDM can receive links in four ways:\n\n1. Share a link from any browser and pick EDM.\n2. Tap a link and choose EDM from the app chooser — EDM then downloads it directly.\n3. Use the built-in EDM browser; every download on a page is routed to EDM automatically.\n4. Copy a link and open EDM; it offers to download it.\n\nChrome downloads most files itself; use the share sheet or the EDM browser for those pages.</string>
