    <string name="settings_about_title">About EDM</string>
    <string name="settings_about_text">EDM is a multi-threaded download manager in Material Design 2 style. It splits a file into up to 32 parallel range requests, resumes interrupted transfers, and can take over links from browsers.\n\nBuilt for Android 8.0 and newer.</string>
